{"id":"1930200421491803500","kind":"article","title":"绘制概念图","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2crTaHNqd6APCtmzXk7x6W"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2025-07-20","updated":"2025-07-23","votes":20,"comment_count":5,"minutes":1,"chars":693,"keywords":["概念图","检索练习","测试效应","学习策略","认知外化"],"summary":"译文把概念图定义为用方框和箭头呈现主题中核心概念及其关系的图表，并汇总两项研究：将概念图用作提取练习时，其测试效应不强于单纯回忆并写下内容；即使与提取练习结合，额外投入时间也未带来显著收益。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1930200421491803500","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"q80PVcRL\">一种学习方法，指学生通过绘制一种「方框-箭头」式的图表来阐释某个主题，该图表旨在呈现核心概念/过程及其相互关系。</p><ul><li data-pid=\"otqRgciY\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3J3QxG3TkZfqkKWTx9cBvi\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">绘制概念图是否涉及内隐提取练习？</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-1\">参考文献</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"QdrLI7Pl\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zKDWDVyZ7kBQLnq6Fq5KSj6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blunt, J. R., &amp; Karpicke, J. D. (2014). Learning with retrieval-based concept mapping. Journal of Educational Psychology, 106(3), 849–858</a></li><ul><li data-pid=\"b0MGDmlu\">将绘制概念图用于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zXA8c6XtMLgRCGwJFGnZUvw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">提取练习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>时，其产生的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zTpJdbe6ub7uhBFLuHkFsrT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">测试效应</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>并不比单纯写下回忆内容的效果更强。</li></ul><li data-pid=\"XZFptwiH\">O’Day, G. M., &amp; Karpicke, J. D. (2021). Comparing and combining retrieval practice and concept mapping. Journal of Educational Psychology, 113, 986–997.<a class=\"external\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1037/edu0000486\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">doi.org/10.1037/edu0000</span><span class=\"invisible\">486</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></li><ul><li data-pid=\"EF5r3I7O\">「即便组合练习组的学生在学习材料上花费的时间，要显著多于单一练习组的学生，但『概念图与提取练习相结合』的练习方式，相比于『单纯的提取练习』，并未能产生任何额外的好处。」</li></ul></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\"><br/>链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"nZUf-BIm\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"536670074\" href=\"#/post/536670074\">提取练习和迁移学习</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"Yu6lrJBQ\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-2.5-pro，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2crTaHNqd6APCtmzXk7x6W\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Concept mapping</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 绘制概念图是否涉及内隐提取练习？ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1929183905371619597\" href=\"#/post/1929183905371619597\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 提取练习 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1928747840647168044\" href=\"#/post/1928747840647168044\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 测试效应 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"423449068\" href=\"#/post/423449068\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"1929183905371619597","title":"绘制概念图是否涉及内隐提取练习？","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":10,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"